silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_07_role_leg_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'RoleLegYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Role Leg', the role_leg_arrow PetRole -> MittensColimitApex: the clinic-patient social role leg; monic (this specific pet-role at Tartu clinic is unique to Mittens in this diagram) but not epic.; also, In 'Role Leg', the bfo_type_arrow records that PetRole is typed under BFO:0000023 (role); BFO:0000023 is shared by all role-type nodes, so not monic." .
